    "input": {
      "body": "Hi Robert,\n\nMy earlier example focused on turning intake into documents and tasks. For you as a founding partner, I wonder if the more useful output is something that makes it easier to see what clients are still waiting for.\n\nI'm Pranav, founder of Possible Minds. We help PI firms adopt AI, and I'm trying to understand where it would genuinely help before building around assumptions.\n\nWould surfacing unanswered client questions or pulling together the context needed to answer them be more helpful? Even a brief answer would help, and I'd appreciate your time.\n\nBest,\nPranav\nFounder, Possible Minds",
      "subject": "Re: where AI could compound at Montanez Yu | Injury Lawyers",
